WEBVTT

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:11.387
Check that the Content group
holds your video screens.

00:00:13.373 --> 00:00:19.373
Choose Videos in the side
menu to open a screen.

00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:26.557
Choose Dashboard in the
side menu to go back.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:33.540
Check that a number beside Captions
shows how many videos wait.

00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:42.131
Click Account menu for Demo
Editor at the top right.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:49.585
Check that Preview site shows
the site the way viewers see it.

00:00:52.112 --> 00:00:58.112
Check that Sign out is in this menu.
